                </div>

                <div class="review-card">
                    <div class="review-header">
                        <h3>Great Value for Money</h3>
                        <span class="review-rating">⭐⭐⭐⭐ 4/5</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>Good quality products at reasonable prices. Will buy again!</p>
